                    "propertyValues": {
                        "html": {
                            "type": "TRANSLATION_LITERAL",
                            "value": {
                                "code": null,
                                "comment": "",
                                "message": "<p data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"157\">To ensure a smooth transition and minimize disruptions, administrators should proactively communicate the MFA enforcement mandate to all users. Clear and timely communication helps users understand the purpose of the mandate, the enrollment process, and the deadlines for compliance.</p>\n<p data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"461\"><strong>Recommended Actions</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"461\">Notify users about the upcoming MFA requirement, including the enforcement timeline.</li>\n<li data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"461\">Explain the benefits of MFA and how it helps protect their accounts and organizational data.</li>\n<li data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"461\">Provide instructions or links to documentation on how users can enroll in MFA.</li>\n<li data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"461\">Highlight any support resources, such as help desk contacts or self-service guides.</li>\n<li data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"461\">Share details about exemptions and how users can check their MFA enrollment status.</li>\n</ul>"
                            }
                        }
                    },
